# X0 (PRE-WINDOW, no card opened): status, then delete the image tags that earlier windows left and nothing serves any more: tp4-next-2b, tp4-seats8-rwarm and tp4-tau-1.
# No pack in this repository built tp4-next-2b or tp4-tau-1 (the tau branches and the next-2 build windows named them), so a tag the host does not have is expected: rmi of an absent
# tag must be a no-op. No PROTECTED tag, no serve- or tp4-serve- tag and nothing containing prod is named (the job parser refuses all of them). NEVER delete the P8 base image
# qwen-fast-serving:ci-be9e184e: grep the Dockerfiles for FROM before adding any tag here. tp4-next-3a is NOT listed: the tp4/next-3 hardware window pins it.
# THE RIG PRECONDITION (a STOP job): the status block must show all FOUR boards resolved, no card holder, and 'serving containers: none'. Anything else stops the window here, before S0's
# reset refuses on a missing board and the window loses B0's hour (v335 found three boards present). Confirm first that no other window driver is alive (the next-4 ship window's driver
# ends in agentstart and must be dead or finished). The status cannot see the node agent's user unit from the runner, so 'serving containers: none' is the evidence that production is down.
# READ: the status block, the disk figures before and after, and which tags were removed. Duration (estimate): 10 min. Stop: a failed status or an unmet precondition stops the window.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/next-5 four-card development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-5 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-5a is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/next-5 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status rmi
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-5a
C2_RMI_TAGS=tp4-next-2b tp4-seats8-rwarm tp4-tau-1
